  <item>
    <title>E05｜「快来看看我生的哈基米！ 」—— 跟随小红书上的铲屎官，找到宠物经济新锚点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65042d4b8a2b4abc8d567976</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65042d4b8a2b4abc8d567976</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Sep 2023 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「世界破破烂烂，小狗缝缝补补。」</span><br><span>越来越多年轻人把宠物看作家庭成员，选择执子之爪铲屎到老，宠物也带给我们无可替代的陪伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>宠物和主人的互相治愈不止于此。或许你在小红书上看到过 @王多多 的视频，这只 7 斤重的小泰迪，七年来陪伴主人成长的点点滴滴都被记录在小红书上，不仅萌化了一众用户的心，也减轻了很多养宠新手的焦虑，甚至扭转了大众对泰迪的印象。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://files.fireside.fm/file/fireside-uploads/images/5/5807dce7-57b3-43c9-b732-e78e579a5e14/an-xBsAt.png" alt="「顶流」 王多多"><br><span>「顶流」 王多多 | 图源：小红书宠物博主 @王多多 （是的，多爸给的！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>但养宠路上也不只有轻松和欢乐。越来越多铲屎官开始注重科学喂养，阿尔兹海默症、抑郁症等之前常被忽略的宠物病症也更多被注意到。从宠物驱虫，到科学饮食、谨慎换粮，想要照顾好宠物，铲屎官要关注宠物的衣、食、住等方方面面。随之而来的，也是宠物消费赛道的迅速发展以及产品的精细化和科学化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从养宠人群到养宠新手，再到泛宠人群，品牌要如何准确捕捉用户情绪，锚定用户需求，进而探索宠物经济的蓝海？小红书又能怎样帮助宠物品牌洞察养宠新趋势、发现新增长点？本期节目，我们请到来自雀巢普瑞纳媒介负责人 Dancy、小红书宠物博主@王多多 以及小红书宠物行业观察员可可，一起聊聊小红书社区中，年轻人养宠的新风向，以及品牌如何抓住机遇，帮助用户实现科学养宠。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 埋肚皮、被舔眼泪，宠物治愈我们的那些瞬间</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="521">08:41</a> 解压、治愈、把宠物看作家人，当代年轻人为什么养宠</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 从养宠人群到养宠新手，再到泛宠人群，品牌怎样在小红书实现多层破圈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 在养宠大趋势下，如何探索宠物经济的蓝海</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 定位新手用户，给消费者提供情绪价值，把美好延长</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 减缓衰老、减轻过敏，在与宠物相处的点滴中，品牌如何给宠物提供全生命周期的服务</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2868">47:48</a> 在小红书社区中，品牌如何更高效地触及用户、传播口碑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3168">52:48</a> 推流之外，品牌如何在小红书上挖掘更细分的需求、更有效与用户沟通</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期人物</span></strong><br><span>米基，「薯与趋势」主播</span><br><span>Dancy，雀巢普瑞纳媒介负责人 ，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/601141d90000000001002c3b?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=60dd2c83000000000100b1d8&amp;apptime=1694701217" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/601141d90000000001002c3b?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=60dd2c83000000000100b1d8&amp;apptime=1694701217"><span>@雀巢普瑞纳</span></a><br><span>@王多多，</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c414718000000000702b92b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d4d35700000000012003083&amp;apptime=1694600436" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c414718000000000702b92b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d4d35700000000012003083&amp;apptime=1694600436"><span>小红书宠物博主</span></a><span> </span><br><span>可可，小红书宠物业务负责人 </span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>延伸阅读</span></strong><br><span></span><em><span>一些治愈：</span></em><span> </span><a href="http://xhslink.com/MPCnwu" data-url="http://xhslink.com/MPCnwu"><span>@王多多 多爸记录多多每天上床的视频</span></a><br><span></span><em><span>一些「奇奇怪怪」 ：</span></em><span> 小红书站内热门宠物话题</span><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/page/topics/638f2c44dad5d80001539142?fullscreen=true&amp;naviHidden=yes&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5eedfcc80000000001001635&amp;apptime=1694683335" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/page/topics/638f2c44dad5d80001539142?fullscreen=true&amp;naviHidden=yes&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5eedfcc80000000001001635&amp;apptime=1694683335"><span>#又到了小狗烧焦的季节</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/64acb50c000000001002a099?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=7.91.1&amp;author_share=1&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=video&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5eedfcc80000000001001635&amp;apptime=1694683461" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/64acb50c000000001002a099?app_platform=ios&amp;app_version=7.91.1&amp;author_share=1&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=video&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5eedfcc80000000001001635&amp;apptime=1694683461"><span>#给你看看我生的哈基米</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/64c37e0d000000001201f0a5?app_platform=android&amp;app_version=8.4.0&amp;author_share=2&amp;ignoreEngage=true&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=video&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=60dd2c83000000000100b1d8&amp;apptime=1694701366&amp;wechatWid=e3a55ce10c2d4bacf108f18d6b88ea17&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/64c37e0d000000001201f0a5?app_platform=android&amp;app_version=8.4.0&amp;author_share=2&amp;ignoreEngage=true&amp;share_from_user_hidden=true&amp;type=video&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=60dd2c83000000000100b1d8&amp;apptime=1694701366&amp;wechatWid=e3a55ce10c2d4bacf108f18d6b88ea17&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>来自雀巢普瑞纳的推荐笔记：32岁的长寿猫咪，它的主人是怎么喂出来的？</span></a><br><span></span><em><span>一些最新行业趋势 ：</span></em><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GVqZsTybnPn4xywcW-PFgQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GVqZsTybnPn4xywcW-PFgQ"><span>《小红书萌宠趋势报告》</span></a><br><span></span><em><span>一些品牌必看种草小秘籍：</span></em><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XsPxYDtHVHxJGQfkx3mrRw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XsPxYDtHVHxJGQfkx3mrRw"><span>《宠物行业双11种草秘籍》</span></a><br><span></span><a href="https://ditto.xiaohongshu.net/ditto/vincent/288a7bdef1f547a8ae674460ac53f065?naviHidden=yes&amp;fullscreen=true&amp;source=share&amp;instance_id=288a7bdef1f547a8ae674460ac53f065&amp;page_instance=2683&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55a9bb8967bc650a5cd8ea2e&amp;apptime=1694684116" data-url="https://ditto.xiaohongshu.net/ditto/vincent/288a7bdef1f547a8ae674460ac53f065?naviHidden=yes&amp;fullscreen=true&amp;source=share&amp;instance_id=288a7bdef1f547a8ae674460ac53f065&amp;page_instance=2683&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55a9bb8967bc650a5cd8ea2e&amp;apptime=1694684116"><span>小红书宠物行业营销IP「养宠百科全书」</span></a><span>（速来上车！）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>幕后制作</span></strong><br><span>监制：米基、卡米、婴宁、海海</span><br><span>后期：可特</span><br><span>内容 &amp; 运营：nini、闻晓、瑞涵、迪卡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关注我们</span></strong><br><span>官网：</span><a href="https://e.xiaohongshu.com/home" data-url="https://e.xiaohongshu.com/home"><span>小红书商业化</span></a><br><span>小红书号：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5df0669e000000000100852a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d4d35700000000012003083&amp;apptime=1689565053" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5df0669e000000000100852a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d4d35700000000012003083&amp;apptime=1689565053"><span>商业广告薯</span></a><br><span>公众号：小红书商业动态</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于节目</span></strong><br><span>新趋势背后的商业灵感，一手的品牌种草故事，这里是小红书商业化官方播客。</span><br><span>节目由小红书商业化 &amp; 声动活泼联合制作播出。</span></p><p><span>Special Guests: Dancy, 可可, and 王多多.</span></p>]]></description>
